WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.870
Who met Jesus?

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.000
Follow Luke the doctor. Find the people with stories to tell.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.319
You are Luke's apprentice. Who will you talk to?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.872
My father was there that night.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.128
Father spoke of an angel. And a baby in a manger.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.400
Who saw it?

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.795
Who passed the story on?

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.000
Gather clues in your notebook.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.576
Use what you discover to solve the tasks.
